stateDiagram-v2
    direction LR
    [*] --> ScalarUnknown: program start
    ScalarUnknown --> CallReturned: call bpf_map_lookup_elem
    state CallReturned <<choice>>
    CallReturned --> PTR_OR_NULL: r0 = result

    state "PTR_TO_MAP_VALUE_OR_NULL\n(deref FORBIDDEN)" as PTR_OR_NULL
    state "PTR_TO_MAP_VALUE\n(deref OK)" as PTR
    state "scalar = 0\n(unreachable for non-NULL)" as ScalarZero

    PTR_OR_NULL --> NullCheck: if (!r0)
    state NullCheck <<choice>>
    NullCheck --> PTR: false branch\n(r0 != NULL)
    NullCheck --> ScalarZero: true branch\n(r0 == NULL)

    PTR --> [*]: deref accepted
    ScalarZero --> [*]: must not deref\n(verifier rejects if you try)

    PTR_OR_NULL --> Reject: deref without check
    state "REJECT\n'R0 invalid mem access\nmap_value_or_null'" as Reject
    Reject --> [*]
